<title>UK: HK stocks in London closed after HK public holiday.</title>
<headline>HK stocks in London closed after HK public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong stocks in London were closed for trade on Tuesday following a market and public holiday in Hong Kong to mark the resumption of China's sovereignty over the former British colony.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
